   "stem": "Let $[t]$ denote the largest integer less than or equal to $t$. If $\\int_{0}^{3}\\left([x^{2}] + \\left[\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right]\\right)dx = a + b\\sqrt{2} - \\sqrt{3} - \\sqrt{5} + c\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{7}$, where $a, b, c \\in \\mathbb{Z}$, then $a + b + c$ is equal to ______",
